---
term: Operations
aka:
  - Level 3
layer: L3
section: evolution-and-protection
order: 70
definition: The outermost [[tiered constitutional design|constitutional layer]], which holds strategies, procedures, quantitative targets, and temporary policies.
seeAlso:
  - substantive-constitution
